 </span><span begin="00:54.110" end="00:55.160">lover</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.190" end="00:57.830"><span begin="00:55.190" end="00:55.700">Stop </span><span begin="00:55.700" end="00:56.360">falling </span><span begin="00:56.360" end="00:56.690">for </span><span begin="00:56.690" end="00:57.020">these </span><span begin="00:57.020" end="00:57.830">boys</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.860" end="01:00.350"><span begin="00:57.860" end="00:58.250">Who </span><span begin="00:58.250" end="00:58.550">didn't </span><span begin="00:58.550" end="00:58.790">want </span><span begin="00:58.790" end="00:58.880">the </span><span begin="00:58.880" end="00:59.240">same </span><span begin="00:59.240" end="00:59.450">as </span><span begin="00:59.450" end="01:00.350">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.410" end="01:06.170"><span begin="01:00.410" end="01:00.800">I </span><span begin="01:00.800" end="01:01.100">was </span><span begin="01:01.100" end="01:01.820">warned </span><span begin="01:01.820" end="01:02.120">by </span><span begin="01:02.120" end="01:02.450">my </span><span begin="01:02.450" end="01:03.770">brothers </span><span begin="01:03.770" end="01:04.010">to </span><span begin="01:04.010" end="01:04.460">find </span><span begin="01:04.460" end="01:05.030">another </span><span begin="01:05.030" end="01:06.170">lover</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.200" end="01:08.810"><span begin="01:06.200" end="01:06.590">Stop </span><span begin="01:06.590" end="01:07.280">falling </span><span begin="01:07.280" end="01:07.610">for </span><span begin="01:07.610" end="01:07.940">these </span><span begin="01:07.940" end="01:08.810">boys</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.840" end="01:11.450"><span begin="01:08.840" end="01:09.170">Who </span><span begin="01:09.170" end="01:09.500">didn't </span><span begin="01:09.500" end="01:09.710">want </span><span begin="01:09.710" end="01:09.800">the </span><span begin="01:09.800" end="01:10.130">same </spa