 end="01:42.410">love </span><span begin="01:42.410" end="01:42.740">with </span><span begin="01:42.740" end="01:43.790">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.120" end="01:48.320"><span begin="01:44.120" end="01:45.440">I </span><span begin="01:45.440" end="01:45.770">need </span><span begin="01:45.770" end="01:46.130">to </span><span begin="01:46.130" end="01:46.610">grow </span><span begin="01:46.610" end="01:46.730">and </span><span begin="01:46.730" end="01:47.180">find </span><span begin="01:47.180" end="01:48.320">myself</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.470" end="01:50.960"><span begin="01:48.470" end="01:48.890">Before </span><span begin="01:48.890" end="01:49.040">I </span><span begin="01:49.040" end="01:49.310">let </span><span begin="01:49.310" end="01:50.030">somebody </span><span begin="01:50.030" end="01:50.420">love </span><span begin="01:50.420" end="01:50.960">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.170" end="01:54.050"><span begin="01:51.170" end="01:51.470">Because </span><span begin="01:51.470" end="01:51.590">at </span><span begin="01:51.590" end="01:51.740">the </span><span begin="01:51.740" end="01:52.370">moment </span><span begin="01:52.370" end="01:52.580">I </span><span begin="01:52.580" end="01:52.940">don't </span><span begin="01:52.940" end="01:53.210">know </span><span begin="01:53.210" end="01:54.050">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.950" end="01:57.980"><span begin="01:54.950" end="01:55.220">When </span><span begin="01:55.220" end="01:55.340">I </span><span begin="01:55.340" end="01:55.640">was </span><span begin="01:55.640" end="01:56.360">told </span><span begin="01:56.360" end="01:56.660">by </span><span begin="01:56.660" end="01:56.930">my </span><span begin="01:56.930" end="01:57.980">father</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.220" end="02:00.890"><span begin="01:58.220" end="01:58.490">If </span><span begin="01:58.490" end="01:58.580">I </span><span begin="01:58.580" end="01:59.000">look </spa